Gym Class Heroes' music video for 'Stereo Hearts' featuring Adam Levine from the album, The Papercut Chronicles II - available now on DCD2 Records / Fueled By Ramen.

Go behind the scenes of this video at http://youtu.be/y3lMx6sfEzs

Directed by Hiro Murai

